The preparation script rejects any source package whose hash differs. The JDK
launchers are Android API 24 AArch64 ELF files using /system/bin/linker64. The
bundle retains the complete Java runtime module image plus java, javac, jar,
jarsigner, and keytool. It removes development-only jmods, sources, headers,
demos, and manuals. Android compatibility libraries are placed in jdk/lib and
selected with the app's private LD_LIBRARY_PATH.

